cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
title: >-
  Spillway Workbench (SWB): cross-platform Python reimplementation of the
  USBR Cavitation Programs and companion tool to Cavicuspill
abstract: >-
  A unified Python 3 / PySide6 workbench merging two hydraulic programs:
  Cavicuspill (spillway design: flood routing, WES overflow profile,
  cavitation screening; originally VB6, M.Sc. thesis, University of Sana'a,
  2004) and EM-Py (a port of the U.S. Bureau of Reclamation "Cavitation
  Programs" by H. T. Falvey, 1987/1990: water-surface profile, cavitation
  index, damage index, aerator trajectory, equal-cavitation-number design).
  The two share an MDI shell, a unified application state, bidirectional
  geometry/damage bridges, a CLI, and a standalone Windows executable.
